<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>100mph</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Løvesick</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">100mph</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7rd2VWk3FGJ40PM4jFgD1T</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.800" end="00:14.670">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.670" end="00:16.870">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.870" end="00:20.270">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.270" end="00:22.680">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.680" end="00:25.630">I see red and blue now this can't be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.630" end="00:28.210">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.210" end="00:31.140">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.140" end="00:33.800">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.800" end="00:36.530">2:45 AM</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.530" end="00:39.730">Why are we still here again?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.730" end="00:42.650">You wanna argue let's go back inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.650" end="00:45.340">Keep it on the low cause I don't wanna fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.340" end="00:47.620">A blue dress a white car and a cocktail</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.620" end="00:50.870">Is what you want, I know that's what you want girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.870" end="00:53.880">You show off you know that I'm attached girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.880" end="00:56.560">It's what you want, I know that's what you want girl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.560" end="00:59.790">You said you loved me now you say you hate me now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.790" end="01:02.480">Don't know what is true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.480" end="01:05.060">You said the shit that we went through ain't deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.060" end="01:08.080">But babe as you cried I was there when you needed me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.080" end="01:11.750">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.750" end="01:13.820">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.820" end="01:17.330">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.330" end="01:20.090">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.090" end="01:22.680">I see red and blue now this can't be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.680" end="01:25.650">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.650" end="01:28.260">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.260" end="01:30.760">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.760" end="01:33.650">Everyone thinks that I'm fucked in the head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.650" end="01:36.510">They must not realize that you were instead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.510" end="01:39.260">All of those years acting like you're attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.260" end="01:42.120">Leave me behind he leaves you in his bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.120" end="01:45.180">Two hour drive babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.180" end="01:48.040">I'll be there right away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.040" end="01:50.980">You got me tied up but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.980" end="01:53.610">I want you anyway</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.610" end="01:56.240">Babe you're not even sober don't talk</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.240" end="01:59.430">Speech is delayed you don't know what you're on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.430" end="02:02.110">Tell all your friends that you haven't moved on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.110" end="02:05.360">Go with another you cope with my</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.360" end="02:09.060">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.060" end="02:11.160">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.160" end="02:14.610">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.610" end="02:17.080">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.080" end="02:19.420">I see red and blue now this can't be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.420" end="02:22.690">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.690" end="02:25.640">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.640" end="02:27.730">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.730" end="02:30.980">Everyone thinks that I'm fucked in the head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.980" end="02:33.600">They must not realize that you were instead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.600" end="02:36.510">All of those years acting like you're attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.510" end="02:39.420">Leave me behind he leaves you in his bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.420" end="02:43.430">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.430" end="02:46.130">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.130" end="02:49.810">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.810" end="02:52.290">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.290" end="02:55.470">I see red and blue now this can't be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.470" end="02:58.670">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.670" end="03:01.540">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.540" end="03:04.720">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.720" end="03:07.670">Everyone thinks that I'm fucked in the head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.670" end="03:10.820">They must not realize that you were instead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.820" end="03:14.130">All of those years acting like you're attached</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.130" end="03:17.840">Leave me behind he leaves you in his bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.840" end="03:21.840" /></div></body></tt>